OL,3,AAre we back in big tech's 'move fast
OL,4,Aand break things' era?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Move fast and break things."
OL,8,FIt was a mantra coined by the tech
OL,9,Fgiant Meta and used until 2012, which
OL,10,Fcame to define the bad old days of
OL,11,Fsocial media running riot in a feeding
OL,12,Ffrenzy of user data.
OL,14,FYet now we have large companies
OL,15,Fscrambling to develop ever more
OL,16,Fpowerful AI, in an intense global race
OL,17,Fto be first to build the world's most
OL,18,Fadvanced models, egged on by US
OL,19,FPresident Donald Trump.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,110,105,200,160,0,100
