OL,3,AAre we back in big tech's 'move fast
OL,4,Aand break things' era?
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite numerous pledges, commitments
OL,7,Fand open letters over the years from
OL,8,Fthe industry, promising to prioritise
OL,9,Fsafe, responsible AI aligned with human
OL,10,Fvalues, examples of bots behaving badly
OL,11,F` to put it mildly - are now coming at
OL,12,Fus thick and fast.
